{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54980","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出军日，龙现衆人惊。\n急令（京本作「命」）师（京本作「帅」）回休强去（辛本、川本、京本作「进」），若还坚执往前行（京本作「向前营」），枉损马和兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}